--- b1a: Sequencing trap: red TAKI + red STOP + red +2 + red 5 on a red 3.
  hand [red taki, red stop, red 2+, red 5] | showing red 3 | NORMAL
  move                            Q       dQ
  ------------------------------------------
  play red taki               -7.31     0.00   <- picks this
  play red stop              -13.96    -6.65
  play red 2+                -15.46    -8.15
  play red 5                 -23.39   -16.07
  draw                       -25.66   -18.34

  correct line: Open the TAKI, play STOP and +2 in either order, finish on the red 5 -> wins outright.
  the policy actually plays:
  1. play red taki            hand 4 -> 3
  2. play red 2+              hand 3 -> 2
  3. play red stop            hand 2 -> 1
  4. play red 5               hand 1 -> 0   *** WINS ***

